'' One byref-ustring rule on every path (UStrRefArg_): a ustring*N or wide argument to a constructor,
'' a += operator and a binary operator is copied in and back, the binary operator's copy-back right
'' after its call. The constructor and operator paths handed over the raw UTF-16 buffer and crashed.
'' Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/strarg-ustring-ref-paths.bas -o tests/codegen/strargustringrefpaths.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/strargustringrefpaths.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ctor uf: [uf] uf=[C]
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: op uf: [u2] uf=[O]
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ctor w: [ww]
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: cat: [u2&A] uf=[A]
